Z||000000||sjp777||05-22-2001||09:03 PM||||Uncork the champagne. It was on this day 2 years ago that I traveled to mid Wisconsin to pick up my baby.<P>Here we are together shortly after I got her home<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/moi_et_le_bijou.jpg"> <P>And I'm sure you're all getting sick of looking at this one, but here she is again as she is today. It's been a pretty productive 2 years don't ya think?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890.jpg"> <P>2 years and our love affair is still as strong as that first day. In fact, it has only just begun. Wait 'til you see her in another 2 years.<P>Jeez I need to get out of the garage and get a real girlfriend.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_2.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||10
