Z||000015||Tigger||05-23-2001||08:28 AM||||Cool Fiero sip777!!!<P>My 2nd anniversary with my Fiero is coming up next month!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'll say the relationship was really rough for the first year.  She wanted to take things out on me because her ex neglected and abused her pretty bad.  Lately she's gotten over a lot of issues, realized that I'm not like her ex, and has been treating me alright.      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I think I need to get out of the garage too.  Hehe..      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 05-23-2001).]||||reg||14
